To reflect fur along the axes:

  - Open the model group and select the skin;

  - In the Hair and Fur modifier in the Tools tab, select Guides -> Splines;

  - Wait until the end of the operation to create splines, on the basis of which the fur of your reflected model will be built;

  - Add the created splines to the general group of the model, close the group and reflect the model along the desired axis;

  - Ungroup, make X-FORM of all elements of the model;

  - Select the skin, in the Hair and Fur modifier in the Tools tab, select Recomb From Splines;

  - Then click on the previously created splines. As a result, the fur will be recalculated based on your splines;

  - Remove splines and close the model group.

